  "rationales": {
    "U": "证据片段：'GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060 1.1 MAN Issued For source generation GOG has 2 main options available: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080 1.1 MAN Issued GOG has a source by source processing mechanism GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100 1.1 MAN Issued GOG must consider noise effects.' – 整个文本将多个需求点混合在一起，缺乏清晰分隔和结构，导致难以快速理解各个需求的具体内容。",
    "A": "证据片段：'or a Object Input Catalogue' – 语法错误，应使用 'an' 而非 'a'；'source by source processing mechanism' – 术语模糊，未明确 'source' 的含义或处理机制的具体定义，可能存在歧义。",
    "C": "证据片段：整个需求文本 – 假设需求意图正确（如选项和噪声考虑是系统所需），但表述中的语法和模糊性可能隐含错误，影响正确性的判断。",
    "V": "证据片段：'GOG must consider noise effects' – 动词 'consider' 未定义具体行为或标准，无法确定如何测试或验证是否满足了该需求。"
  },
  "suggestions": {
    "U": "改写为三个独立的原子需求：1) For source generation, GOG has two main options: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or an Object Input Catalogue. 2) GOG implements a source-by-source processing mechanism. 3) GOG must account for noise effects in its processing.",
    "A": "修正语法：将 'a Object Input Catalogue' 改为 'an Object Input Catalogue'；澄清术语：定义 'source-by-source processing mechanism' 为 'a mechanism that processes each astronomical source individually'。",
    "C": "保持不变，但建议在正式文档中验证选项的完整性和噪声考虑的必要性。",
    "V": "指定噪声考虑的具体方式：例如，'GOG must simulate noise effects using a defined noise model with parameters specified in the system requirements.'"
  },
  "issues": [
    {
      "type": "U",
      "evidence": "GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060 1.1 MAN Issued For source generation GOG has 2 main options available: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080 1.1 MAN Issued GOG has a source by source processing mechanism GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100 1.1 MAN Issued GOG must consider noise effects.",
      "rewrite": "For source generation, GOG has two main options: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or an Object Input Catalogue. GOG implements a source-by-source processing mechanism. GOG must account for noise effects in its processing."
    },
    {
      "type": "A",
      "evidence": "or a Object Input Catalogue",
      "rewrite": "an Object Input Catalogue"
    },
    {
      "type": "V",
      "evidence": "GOG must consider noise effects",
      "rewrite": "GOG must simulate noise effects with parameters defined in the noise model specification."
    }
  ]
}

