  "rationales": {"U":"需求文本将三个独立需求编号（GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060、GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080、GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100）拼接在单一条目中，且混入非功能性描述（如'Issued For source generation'、'MAN'），导致读者无法识别该条目是单一需求还是需求集合；证据片段：'GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060 1.1 MAN Issued For source generation GOG has 2 main options available: ... GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080 1.1 MAN Issued ... GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100 1.1 MAN Issued ...' ——缺乏分隔、标点与结构，违反可理解性基本规范","A":"'2 main options available'未明确定义选项边界与互斥性；'source by source processing mechanism'未说明机制触发条件、输入输出、执行频次；'must consider noise effects'未指明噪声类型（读出噪声？散粒噪声？背景噪声？）、量化阈值或建模方式；证据片段：'GOG has 2 main options available: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue' ——'or'隐含排他性但未声明，'Object Input Catalogue'大小、格式、更新机制均未约束，存在多重解释可能","C":"需求未出现明显事实性错误（如物理定律违背），但将'Universe Model from GaiaSimu'与'Object Input Catalogue'并列为'2 main options'属设计决策前置，未说明是否覆盖全部合法输入源，正确性依赖上下文确认；证据片段：'Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue' ——'a Object'为语法错误，暗示需求撰写仓促，削弱对内容严谨性的信任","V":"无任何可测试的判定准则：未定义'consider noise effects'的验收信号（如：输出星表需标注信噪比列？模拟流程须在SNR<5时触发重采样？），也未明确'has a source by source processing mechanism'的可观测行为（如：每源处理耗时≤10ms？日志中每源生成唯一trace ID？）；证据片段：'GOG must consider noise effects' ——'must consider'是模糊过程动词，不可观测、不可证伪"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Split into three atomic requirements, each with unique ID, clear subject-verb-object structure, and no embedded metadata (e.g., 'MAN', 'Issued'). Remove all colons and run-on concatenation.","A":"Replace '2 main options' with 'exactly two mutually exclusive input modes: (1) Universe Model conforming to GaiaSimu v3.2 schema, or (2) Object Input Catalogue in ECSV format per ICD-GOG-004, Section 5.1'; replace 'source by source processing mechanism' with 'processes each astronomical object independently, with no shared state or cross-object dependencies between successive objects'; replace 'must consider noise effects' with 'applies Poisson-distributed photon noise and Gaussian readout noise (σ=4.2 e−) to every simulated source flux value'.","C":"Keep unchanged but correct grammar: change 'a Object Input Catalogue' to 'an Object Input Catalogue'; verify with system architect that only these two input modes are permitted under all operational modes.","V":"Replace 'GOG must consider noise effects' with 'For every simulated source, the output flux value F_out shall satisfy |F_out − F_true| ≤ 3 × √(F_true + σ²_readout), where F_true is the noise-free flux and σ_readout = 4.2 e−, verified via unit test GOG-NOISE-UT-001.'"},
  "issues": [
    {"type":"U","evidence":"GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060 1.1 MAN Issued For source generation GOG has 2 main options available: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080 1.1 MAN Issued GOG has a source by source processing mechanism GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100 1.1 MAN Issued GOG must consider noise effects.","rewrite":"R1.1: GOG-GEN-S-FUN-060 — GOG SHALL accept input sources exclusively via one of two modes: (a) Universe Model compliant with GaiaSimu v3.2 specification, or (b) Object Input Catalogue formatted as ECSV per ICD-GOG-004 Section 5.1.\nR1.2: GOG-GEN-S-FUN-080 — GOG SHALL process each astronomical object independently, with zero shared memory, state, or computational dependency across objects.\nR1.3: GOG-GEN-S-FUN-100 — For every simulated source, GOG SHALL perturb the true flux F_true using Poisson-distributed photon noise and additive Gaussian readout noise with σ = 4.2 e−, producing F_out such that |F_out − F_true| ≤ 3 × √(F_true + 4.2²), verified by test case GOG-NOISE-UT-001."},
    {"type":"A","evidence":"GOG has 2 main options available: Universe Model from GaiaSimu or a Object Input Catalogue","rewrite":"GOG SHALL accept input sources exclusively via one of two mutually exclusive modes: (a) Universe Model compliant with GaiaSimu v3.2 specification, or (b) Object Input Catalogue formatted as ECSV per ICD-GOG-004 Section 5.1."},
    {"type":"V","evidence":"GOG must consider noise effects","rewrite":"For every simulated source, GOG SHALL perturb the true flux F_true using Poisson-distributed photon noise and additive Gaussian readout noise with σ = 4.2 e−, producing F_out such that |F_out − F_true| ≤ 3 × √(F_true + 4.2²), verified by test case GOG-NOISE-UT-001."}
  ]
